  "body": "We have a [WPT](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/semantics/interactive-elements/the-dialog-element/simulated-click-inert.html) for modal dialog which expects clicking the label which inside the modal dialog could trigger the click event at the input element which is outside of the modal dialog. \r\n\r\nHowever this behaviour seems undefined since the input element is inert. \r\n\r\n@smaug---- @emilio @domenic @nt1m ",
